2026-11-06T03:00:26.4476830Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:26.4477141Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-11-06T03:00:26.4477613Z 
2026-11-06T03:00:26.4477886Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
