2026-11-06T03:00:26.4483635Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-06T03:00:26.4484218Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-06T03:00:26.4484725Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-06T03:00:26.4485279Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-06T03:00:26.4485674Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-06T03:00:26.4486224Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-06T03:00:26.4486761Z    /root
2026-11-06T03:00:26.4494354Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-06T03:00:26.4496242Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-06T03:00:26.4505588Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-06T03:00:26.4506395Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-06T03:00:26.4508148Z 
